{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/vue/04_이벤트바인딩/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<h2 id=\"click-event-binding\" style=\"position:relative;\">click event binding<a href=\"#click-event-binding\" aria-label=\"click event binding permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>v-on:click=“script”</li>\n<li>@click=“script”</li>\n</ul>\n<p>두 가지 문법</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">&lt;button v-on:click=&quot;자바스크립트~~&quot;&gt;허위매물신고&lt;/button&gt;\r\n&lt;button @click=&quot;자바스크립트~~&quot;&gt;허위매물신고&lt;/button&gt;</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"버튼을-클릭하면-신고수-증가하기\" style=\"position:relative;\">버튼을 클릭하면 신고수 증가하기<a href=\"#%EB%B2%84%ED%8A%BC%EC%9D%84-%ED%81%B4%EB%A6%AD%ED%95%98%EB%A9%B4-%EC%8B%A0%EA%B3%A0%EC%88%98-%EC%A6%9D%EA%B0%80%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0\" aria-label=\"버튼을 클릭하면 신고수 증가하기 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">&lt;template&gt;\r\n  &lt;button @click=&quot;신고수++&quot;&gt;허위매물신고&lt;/button&gt; &lt;span&gt;신고수: {{ 신고수 }}&lt;/span&gt;\r\n&lt;/template&gt;\r\n\r\n// @click=&quot;신고수 += 1&quot;\r\n&lt;script&gt;\r\nexport default {\r\n  name: &#39;App&#39;,\r\n  data(){\r\n    return {\r\n      // 데이터 보관함\r\n      // 데이터는 object 자료형으로 저장한다. {자료이름:자료내용}\r\n      메뉴들: [&#39;Home&#39;, &#39;Shop&#39;, &#39;About&#39;],\r\n      products : [&#39;역삼동원룸&#39;, &#39;천호동원룸&#39;, &#39;마포구원룸&#39;],\r\n      신고수: 0,\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  components: {\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n&lt;/script&gt;</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"클릭-외에-여러가지-이벤트\" style=\"position:relative;\">클릭 외에 여러가지 이벤트<a href=\"#%ED%81%B4%EB%A6%AD-%EC%99%B8%EC%97%90-%EC%97%AC%EB%9F%AC%EA%B0%80%EC%A7%80-%EC%9D%B4%EB%B2%A4%ED%8A%B8\" aria-label=\"클릭 외에 여러가지 이벤트 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>@mouseover</li>\n<li>@input</li>\n<li>@drag</li>\n<li>…</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"함수\" style=\"position:relative;\">함수<a href=\"#%ED%95%A8%EC%88%98\" aria-label=\"함수 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>vue는 함수를 만드는 공간이 정해져있다.<br>\n데이터 끝나는 부분에 methods: { }</p>\n<p>함수 내에서 데이터 변수를 사용하려면 this.변수명 으로 사용한다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">&lt;template&gt;\r\n  &lt;button @click=&quot;increase&quot;&gt;허위매물신고&lt;/button&gt; &lt;span&gt;신고수: {{ 신고수 }}&lt;/span&gt;\r\n&lt;/template&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;script&gt;\r\nexport default {\r\n  name: &#39;App&#39;,\r\n  data(){\r\n    return {\r\n      // 데이터 보관함\r\n      // 데이터는 object 자료형으로 저장한다. {자료이름:자료내용}\r\n      메뉴들: [&#39;Home&#39;, &#39;Shop&#39;, &#39;About&#39;],\r\n      products : [&#39;역삼동원룸&#39;, &#39;천호동원룸&#39;, &#39;마포구원룸&#39;],\r\n      신고수: 0,\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  methods: {\r\n    // 함수 만드는 공간\r\n    increase(){\r\n      this.신고수+=1;\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  components: {}\r\n}\r\n&lt;script&gt;</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"v-for\" style=\"position:relative;\">v-for<a href=\"#v-for\" aria-label=\"v for permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">&lt;template&gt;\r\n  &lt;div class=&quot;menu&quot;&gt;\r\n    &lt;a v-for=&quot;(a,i) in 메뉴들&quot; :key=&quot;i&quot;&gt;{{a}}&lt;/a&gt;\r\n  &lt;/div&gt;\r\n  &lt;div v-for=&quot;(a,i) in products&quot; :key=&quot;i&quot;&gt;\r\n    &lt;h4&gt;{{ a }}&lt;/h4&gt;\r\n    &lt;p&gt;40 만원&lt;/p&gt;\r\n    &lt;button @click=&quot;신고수[i]++&quot;&gt;허위매물신고&lt;/button&gt; &lt;span&gt;신고수: {{ 신고수[i] }}&lt;/span&gt;\r\n  &lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/template&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;script&gt;\r\nexport default {\r\n  name: &#39;App&#39;,\r\n  data(){\r\n    return {\r\n      // 데이터 보관함\r\n      // 데이터는 object 자료형으로 저장한다. {자료이름:자료내용}\r\n      메뉴들: [&#39;Home&#39;, &#39;Shop&#39;, &#39;About&#39;],\r\n      products : [&#39;역삼동원룸&#39;, &#39;천호동원룸&#39;, &#39;마포구원룸&#39;],\r\n      신고수: [0, 0, 0],\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  methods: {\r\n    // 함수 만드는 공간\r\n  },\r\n  components: {\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n&lt;/script&gt;</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>","tableOfContents":"<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#click-event-binding\">click event binding</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#%EB%B2%84%ED%8A%BC%EC%9D%84-%ED%81%B4%EB%A6%AD%ED%95%98%EB%A9%B4-%EC%8B%A0%EA%B3%A0%EC%88%98-%EC%A6%9D%EA%B0%80%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0\">버튼을 클릭하면 신고수 증가하기</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#%ED%81%B4%EB%A6%AD-%EC%99%B8%EC%97%90-%EC%97%AC%EB%9F%AC%EA%B0%80%EC%A7%80-%EC%9D%B4%EB%B2%A4%ED%8A%B8\">클릭 외에 여러가지 이벤트</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#%ED%95%A8%EC%88%98\">함수</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#v-for\">v-for</a></li>\n</ul>","fields":{"gitLastModified":"Oct 2, 2026"},"frontmatter":{"title":"04. 이벤트 바인딩 v-on, @, 함수","summary":"click event binding - v-on:click=\"script\" - @click=\"script\" 두 가지 문법 <button v-on:click=\"자바스크립트~~\">허위매물신고</button> <button @click=\"자바스크립트~~\">허위매물신고</button> 버튼을 클릭하면 신고수 증가하기","date":"Jun 12, 2023","categories":["VUE"],"tags":[],"author":["aluvy"],"thumbnail":null}}}]}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/posts/vue/04_이벤트바인딩/","prev":{"slug":"/posts/vue/03_반복문/","title":"03. 반복문 v-for"},"next":{"slug":"/posts/vue/05_이미지/","title":"05. 이미지 (require)"}}},"staticQueryHashes":["1397594759","2043619371"],"slicesMap":{}}